WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.227
Reshaping changes how the information is organized.

00:00:03.227 --> 00:00:07.102
It should not silently change the meaning of the information.

00:00:07.102 --> 00:00:11.647
Long data usually stores categories as values in rows.

00:00:11.647 --> 00:00:16.999
Wide data usually turns selected category values into separate columns.

00:00:17.555 --> 00:00:22.197
The important caution is that a reshape can also include aggregation.

00:00:22.197 --> 00:00:29.257
If several source rows are combined into one output cell, we are no longer changing only the layout.

00:00:29.257 --> 00:00:31.882
We are also reducing detail.

00:00:31.882 --> 00:00:38.172
So whenever you reshape data, ask two questions: what structure changed,

00:00:38.172 --> 00:00:41.444
and did any information get summarized or removed?
